# Hollow Crown Platform (this repo)

## Stack load order

`HC-Foundation` → `HollowCrownHub` → minigame plugin(s).

## Where to edit

| Task | Location |
|------|----------|
| Shared API / SPI | `api/src/main/java/com/hollowcrown/api/` |
| Hub lobbies, queue, parties | `hub/src/main/java/com/hollowcrown/hub/` |
| Iron Legacy match logic | `minigames/iron-legacy/` |
| New minigame | `minigames/<id>/` + root `pom.xml` module |

## Integration

- Minigames register `MinigameMechanic` on `GamePlatform` via `MinigameBootstrap`.
- Hub owns `templates.yml`, lobby worlds (`*-L#`), `MatchQueueService`, `PreMatchLimboService`.
- Do not add `depend` on minigames in Hub; integration is Bukkit services + mechanics.

## New minigame (when the user asks)

When the user wants a **new Hub minigame plugin**:

1. Copy `minigames/_template/` → `minigames/<game-id>/` (do not build from `_template` in place).
2. Find-replace placeholders: `YOUR_GAME_ID`, `YourGame`, `yourgame`, `Your Game`, packages, `artifactId`, plugin name.
3. Add `<module>minigames/<game-id></module>` to the root `pom.xml`.
4. Update `CHANGELOG.md` under `[Unreleased]`.
5. Commit locally with `feat(minigames): scaffold <game-id>`.
6. Implement game logic in the new module; use `iron-legacy/` as the reference.
7. **Never `git push`** unless the user explicitly asks to push in that message.

If `game-id` or display name is missing, ask once before copying.
